          "id": "PRR_kwDOE3b6388AAAABLbG8VQ",
          "author": {
            "login": "mysterymath"
          },
          "authorAssociation": "MEMBER",
          "body": "Ah, this scenario is explicitly impossible, just for a reason that isn't checked. CmpZero should be a terminator, but it isn't. So it seems the right move here is... to make it a terminator. This also should allow improving the iteration here to just scan terminators.",
