            "login": "mysterymath"
          },
          "authorAssociation": "MEMBER",
          "body": "The code for this seems fine, but we definitely shouldn't test this in the SDK. We generally route generic C++ functionality using the simulator to llvm-test-suite. It's *really* surprising that there isn't a test for this behavior there; maybe there is one and we just haven't turned it on for some reason? If there isn't such a test and we can't find an easy way to enable it, then it still seems preferable to add the test there, as it is tried in many more scenarios than the SDK tests are (given the difficulty of running tests in real-system emulation).",
